A-share TradingAgents

This repository is a derivative work based on TauricResearch/TradingAgents:
https://github.com/TauricResearch/TradingAgents

The derivative adds an A-share data layer, China-market context, A-share
trading rules and risk controls, portfolio-aware position actions, a
valuation-trend-position matrix, related CLI changes, schemas, prompts, and
tests. Modified Python source files carry a notice pointing to this file.

